From 2643cd5111b8880fe99b990884d8944df45205d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aaron Lilla <55731138+aaronlilla@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 18:20:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Windows: read-only virtio-pmem on WHPX

--pmem path=<img>,ro=true now builds a main-process virtio-pmem device on Windows.
Image is one PAGE_READONLY file view, mapped with WHvMapGpaRange read|execute.
Image size must be a multiple of 2 MiB. Writable pmem, vma-size and swap-interval are refused.
FLUSH answers OK in the worker; DISCARD and pageout never run on Windows.
